{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1601020414","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"1601020414","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1620707001:1":{"text":"Lenor...","source_cn":"莱纳斯……莱纳斯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x835E35B21C14286D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620707002:1":{"text":"Pippa! Looking for me? I'm right here!","source_cn":"嘿！皮帕，你是在找我吗？我就在你旁边！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65DF9A80E3FE0AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620707003:1":{"text":"S-sorry! I didn't see you there!","source_cn":"对对对对不起！我刚才没有看到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE258A3E04F9AFB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620707004:1":{"text":"Magister Merlin's here too! He just tried your chaos magic invention!","source_cn":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><fema...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x11A41F7C95FA372E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Magister Merlin's here too! He just tried your chaos magic invention!","female":"Magister Merlin's here too! She just tried your chaos magic invention!","variant_male_record_index":"203838","variant_female_record_index":"203839","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620707005:1":{"text":"Seriously, thank you for teaching me. It's phenomenal! I can't wait to show the rest of the school!","source_cn":"说起来还要感谢你教会了我用它，太了不起了！我已经迫不及...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD25C2C91C1575C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620707006:1":{"text":"Eh? W-wait! That's exactly why I'm here!","source_cn":"欸……啊啊啊等等！我想找你说的就是这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DA4E24F0441FC28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620707007:1":{"text":"I taught you chaos magic yesterday! So why is everyone suddenly doing it today?!","source_cn":"我记得我昨天只教了你使用混沌魔法的方法，为什么今天学校...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757F21D9CD70715B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620707008:1":{"text":"Well... news travels fast when it's fun!","source_cn":"这个……一传十十传百嘛，好玩的事情大家都想尝试！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B5A2A31053D43CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620707009:1":{"text":"But chaos magic isn't stable!","source_cn":"可是，没办法控制魔法的结果，就有可能发生危险的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1667625042A9210D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620707010:1":{"text":"If s